{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "API de Gestión de Facturas",
    "description": "API para crear facturas de cliente y proveedor en Odoo.\n\n## Autenticación\nTodos los endpoints requieren la cabecera `X-API-Key`.\n\n## Formato de respuesta\nLas respuestas incluyen `success` y `message`. Cuando aplica, también incluyen `data` o `error_code`.\n\n## Tipos de factura\n- `out_invoice`: factura de cliente\n- `out_refund`: rectificativa de cliente\n- `in_invoice`: factura de proveedor\n- `in_refund`: rectificativa de proveedor\n\n## Validaciones destacadas\n- Para proveedor (`in_invoice`, `in_refund`), `ref` es obligatorio.\n- Para cliente (`out_invoice`, `out_refund`), `date` e `invoice_date` deben coincidir.\n- Los strings `number`, `ref` y `invoice_line_ids[].name` se recortan antes de validar y persistir.\n- El diario debe existir, ser `sale` o `purchase`, estar habilitado para sincronización ERP y pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key.\n- El método de pago preferido debe ser `inbound` en ventas y `outbound` en compras, y pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key.\n- `invoice_payment_term_id` puede ser global o pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key.\n- `fiscal_position_id` debe pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key.\n- Las cuentas contables e impuestos de las líneas deben pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key.\n- La precisión decimal de `price_unit`, `quantity` y `discount` se valida con las precisiones configuradas en Odoo.\n- Se validan los IDs de `partner`, `payment term`, `payment method line`, `fiscal position`, `account` y `tax`.\n- El número de factura debe ser único dentro del grupo lógico de tipos cliente o proveedor.\n- La unicidad del número también queda reforzada a nivel de base de datos para evitar duplicados concurrentes.\n\n## Códigos de error\n- `INVALID_API_KEY`: autenticación fallida\n- `INVALID_PARAMETERS`: error de validación\n- `DUPLICATE_INVOICE_NUMBER`: número de factura ya existente\n- `DUPLICATE_KEY_VALUE`: conflicto por clave única\n- `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR`: error inesperado\n",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "license": {
      "name": "LGPL-3.0-or-later",
      "url": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html"
    },
    "contact": {
      "name": "Punt Sistemes"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "{protocol}://{host}:{port}{basePath}",
      "description": "Configuración Personalizada del Servidor",
      "variables": {
        "protocol": {
          "enum": [
            "http",
            "https"
          ],
          "default": "http",
          "description": "Protocolo (http o https)"
        },
        "host": {
          "default": "localhost",
          "description": "Nombre de host o dirección IP del servidor"
        },
        "port": {
          "default": "8069",
          "description": "Número de puerto del servidor"
        },
        "basePath": {
          "default": "/api/v1",
          "description": "Ruta base de la API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApiKeyAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApiKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-API-Key",
        "description": "API key para autenticación"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "ValidationErrorItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Elemento individual de error de validación.",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "loc": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "msg": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "input": {}
        }
      },
      "ApiErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Envelope de error estándar de la API.",
        "properties": {
          "success": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "enum": [
              false
            ]
          },
          "error_code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ValidationErrorResponse": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "data": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "validation_errors": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorItem"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "InvoiceCreateSuccessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Respuesta satisfactoria al crear una factura.",
        "properties": {
          "success": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "enum": [
              true
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "odoo_id": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "erp_id": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "values": {
                "type": "object"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InvoiceLineCreateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "quantity",
          "price_unit",
          "account_id",
          "quantity_erp",
          "extra_operations_erp"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Descripción de la línea de factura. Se recortan los espacios al inicio y al final antes de validar."
          },
          "quantity": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Cantidad."
          },
          "price_unit": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Precio unitario."
          },
          "discount": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Descuento de la línea."
          },
          "account_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID de la cuenta contable (>0). Debe pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "tax_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Lista de impuestos aplicados. Todos deben pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "quantity_erp": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Cantidad ERP. Es obligatorio informar la clave aunque pueda ser `null`."
          },
          "extra_operations_erp": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "Operaciones extra ERP. Es obligatorio informar la clave aunque pueda ser `null`."
          },
          "special_electricity_tax": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Marca de impuesto especial de electricidad."
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "InvoiceCreateRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "pnt_erp_id",
          "number",
          "partner_id",
          "journal_id",
          "invoice_date",
          "amount_untaxed",
          "amount_tax",
          "amount_total",
          "move_type",
          "date",
          "invoice_payment_term_id",
          "preferred_payment_method_line_id",
          "fiscal_position_id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "pnt_erp_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "Identificador único del sistema ERP (>0)."
          },
          "number": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "description": "Número de factura. Se recortan los espacios al inicio y al final antes de validar."
          },
          "partner_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del partner (>0)."
          },
          "journal_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del diario. Debe ser `sale` o `purchase`, estar sincronizado con ERP y pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "invoice_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Fecha de la factura (YYYY-MM-DD)."
          },
          "amount_untaxed": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Base imponible ERP."
          },
          "amount_tax": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Importe de impuestos ERP."
          },
          "amount_total": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Importe total ERP."
          },
          "move_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "out_invoice",
              "out_refund",
              "in_invoice",
              "in_refund"
            ],
            "description": "Tipo de movimiento contable."
          },
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Fecha contable (YYYY-MM-DD)."
          },
          "invoice_payment_term_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del plazo de pago (>0). Debe ser global o pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "preferred_payment_method_line_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID del método de pago preferido (>0). Debe pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "fiscal_position_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "ID de la posición fiscal (>0). Debe pertenecer a la compañía asociada a la API key."
          },
          "ref": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 64,
            "description": "Referencia de proveedor. Obligatoria para `in_invoice` y `in_refund`. Se recortan los espacios al inicio y al final antes de validar."
          },
          "invoice_line_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvoiceLineCreateRequest"
            },
            "description": "Líneas de factura. Si se informa, no puede ser una lista vacía."
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/invoices": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Crear factura",
        "description": "Crea y publica una factura de cliente o proveedor (`account.move`).\n\nEl endpoint valida el cuerpo JSON con `InvoiceCreateSchema`, recorta los strings de entrada visibles para el contrato y delega en el modelo `account.move` la validación de diario, relaciones, unicidad y precisión decimal, crea el movimiento y lo publica automáticamente.\n",
        "operationId": "create_invoice",
        "tags": [
          "Facturas"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvoiceCreateRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "pnt_erp_id": 5001,
                "number": "FAC/2026/0001",
                "partner_id": 123,
                "journal_id": 5,
                "invoice_date": "2026-04-02",
                "amount_untaxed": 100.0,
                "amount_tax": 0.0,
                "amount_total": 100.0,
                "move_type": "out_invoice",
                "date": "2026-04-02",
                "invoice_payment_term_id": 1,
                "preferred_payment_method_line_id": 2,
                "fiscal_position_id": 1,
                "ref": "CUSTOMER REF",
                "invoice_line_ids": [
                  {
                    "name": "Producto ejemplo",
                    "quantity": 1,
                    "price_unit": 100.0,
                    "discount": 0.0,
                    "account_id": 700,
                    "tax_ids": [
                      1
                    ],
                    "quantity_erp": 1,
                    "extra_operations_erp": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Factura creada correctamente",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvoiceCreateSuccessResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Record created successfully",
                  "data": {
                    "odoo_id": 2001,
                    "erp_id": 5001,
                    "values": {
                      "pnt_erp_id": 5001,
                      "number": "FAC/2026/0001",
                      "partner_id": 123,
                      "journal_id": 5,
                      "invoice_date": "2026-04-02",
                      "amount_untaxed": 100.0,
                      "amount_tax": 0.0,
                      "amount_total": 100.0,
                      "move_type": "out_invoice",
                      "date": "2026-04-02",
                      "invoice_payment_term_id": 1,
                      "preferred_payment_method_line_id": 2,
                      "fiscal_position_id": 1,
                      "ref": "CUSTOMER REF",
                      "invoice_line_ids": [
                        {
                          "name": "Producto ejemplo",
                          "quantity": 1,
                          "price_unit": 100.0,
                          "discount": 0.0,
                          "account_id": 700,
                          "tax_ids": [
                            1
                          ],
                          "quantity_erp": 1,
                          "extra_operations_erp": 0
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "metadata": [
                      {
                        "company_id": 1,
                        "company_name": "Compañía Principal",
                        "pnt_erp_id": 5001,
                        "move_type": "out_invoice",
                        "journal_id": [
                          {
                            "id": 5,
                            "display_name": "Ventas"
                          }
                        ],
                        "partner_id": [
                          {
                            "id": 123,
                            "display_name": "Cliente API"
                          }
                        ],
                        "invoice_date": "2026-04-02",
                        "date": "2026-04-02",
                        "invoice_payment_term_id": [
                          {
                            "id": 1,
                            "display_name": "Pago inmediato"
                          }
                        ],
                        "preferred_payment_method_line_id": [
                          {
                            "id": 2,
                            "display_name": "Manual"
                          }
                        ],
                        "fiscal_position_id": [
                          {
                            "id": 1,
                            "display_name": "Posición fiscal"
                          }
                        ],
                        "number": "FAC/2026/0001",
                        "ref": "CUSTOMER REF",
                        "invoice_line_ids": [
                          {
                            "id": 3001,
                            "display_name": "Producto ejemplo"
                          }
                        ],
                        "pnt_amount_untaxed_erp_difference": 0.0,
                        "pnt_amount_tax_erp_difference": 0.0,
                        "pnt_amount_total_erp_difference": 0.0,
                        "pnt_amount_untaxed_erp_discrepancy": false,
                        "pnt_amount_tax_erp_discrepancy": false,
                        "pnt_amount_total_erp_discrepancy": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Solicitud incorrecta - Parámetros inválidos o errores de validación",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missing_field": {
                    "summary": "Campo obligatorio faltante",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "missing",
                            "loc": [
                              "pnt_erp_id"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Field required",
                            "input": {}
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "ref_required_for_vendor": {
                    "summary": "`ref` obligatorio para proveedor",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "value_error",
                            "loc": [],
                            "msg": "Value error, ref is required for vendor bills/refunds",
                            "input": {
                              "move_type": "in_invoice"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_payment_method_consistency": {
                    "summary": "Método de pago incoherente con el diario",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "value_error",
                            "loc": [
                              "preferred_payment_method_line_id"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Payment method must be inbound for sale journals",
                            "input": 2
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_journal": {
                    "summary": "Diario inválido o no sincronizado",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "value_error",
                            "loc": [
                              "journal_id"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Journal is not enabled for ERP synchronization",
                            "input": 9
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_account": {
                    "summary": "Cuenta contable inexistente en línea",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "value_error",
                            "loc": [
                              "invoice_line_ids",
                              0,
                              "account_id"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Invalid account_id: 99999999",
                            "input": 99999999
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "decimals_not_allowed": {
                    "summary": "Demasiados decimales en una línea",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Validation error in request parameters",
                      "data": {
                        "validation_errors": [
                          {
                            "type": "value_error",
                            "loc": [
                              "invoice_line_ids",
                              0,
                              "price_unit"
                            ],
                            "msg": "Amount has 5 decimals; allowed 2",
                            "input": 100.12345
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "odoo_error": {
                    "summary": "Error de validación de Odoo",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "INVALID_PARAMETERS",
                      "message": "Error description from Odoo"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "No autorizado - API key inválida o ausente",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "INVALID_API_KEY",
                  "message": "Invalid or missing API key"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Conflicto - Duplicidad de número de factura o clave única",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "duplicate_invoice_number": {
                    "summary": "Número de factura duplicado",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "DUPLICATE_INVOICE_NUMBER",
                      "message": "Invoice number already exists: FAC/2026/0001"
                    }
                  },
                  "duplicate_erp_id": {
                    "summary": "ERP ID duplicado",
                    "value": {
                      "success": false,
                      "error_code": "DUPLICATE_KEY_VALUE",
                      "message": "Record with provided key already exists: duplicate key value violates unique constraint \"account_move_pnt_erp_id_gt0_uniq\""
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Error interno del servidor - Se devuelve el texto de la excepción capturada",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": false,
                  "error_code": "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR",
                  "message": "Unexpected error message"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
